            "prompt": "Complete FULLY OPAQUE portrait4:5 storybook illustration, target1280x1600. All pixels alpha255/opaque, no transparent edges, no cutouts or atlas. Cozy dimensional gently brushed digitalpainting, detailed natural materials, coherent upperleftsunshine andperspective. No words, labels, logos, landmarks, people,UI,frame orwatermark. Attractivefinishedcleanbackground forlaterdetail layers, noholes. Genericcanalfootpathwithsmallhomesandflowers, intimateeye-level. GOLDEN YELLOW dominatesbroadcottageplasterwalls, warmyellowawning andsunlitfootpath; narrowcalmcanalrightedge turquoiseaccent. No famousbridge or recognizablebuilding. Openwindowupperleftwithbarecurtainrail, no curtain. Thinbarelinebetweenhomesatupperquarterwithgapnearx30%,y19% forlaterpennant. Flowerboxrightwallaroundx77%,y43% withlowfoliage androomforflowerstem. Smallclaypotforegroundleftx15%,y82% hasbarewoodytwig. Smallopaque skyspaceuppermiddleclear. Fivepartsomitted:ivoryyellowpennant, magentageraniumwindowboxstem, simplecreamcurtain, foregroundsagepotsprig, wispycloud. Detailedbeautifulpainted waterandcobbles.",
